sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Parent
  participant UI as Web app
  participant API as API and state machine
  participant Audit as Audit log
  participant Sim as Provider simulator

  Parent->>UI: Request approval
  UI->>API: POST request-approval (Idempotency-Key)
  Note over API: guards: quote valid, KYC verified,<br/>recipient allowlisted, sanctions clear, caps
  API->>Audit: one event, same transaction
  API-->>UI: approval summary + summary_hash

  Parent->>UI: Approve
  UI->>API: POST /auth/mfa/verify (code, scope, payment id)
  API-->>UI: proof: single use, 5 minutes, this payment only
  UI->>API: POST approve (confirm_summary_hash, proof, Idempotency-Key)
  Note over API: AI service accounts are refused here<br/>(AI_CANNOT_APPROVE)
  Note over API: every guard again,<br/>and the hash must match
  API->>Audit: approval event
  API-->>UI: APPROVED

  API->>Sim: submit after the cancellation window
  Sim->>API: HMAC-signed webhook (timestamp, event id)
  Note over API: verify signature, time window,<br/>replay, provider and UETR
  API->>Audit: settled event
  API-->>UI: SETTLED (tracker, UETR, compliance report)
